            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.8.24+2KI.8.25+2KI.8.26+2KI.8.27+2KI.8.28+2KI.8.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 8:24-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu baagira Ahazia mutabani wa Yehoraamu omuto omugabe omu mwanya gwa ishe; ahabw'okuba omutwe gw'abashaija, abaizire omu rusiisira n'Abaharabu, bakaba baitsire abaana bakuru boona. N'ahabw'ekyo Ahazia mwene Yehoraamu omugabe wa Yuda yaategyeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.21.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 21:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahazia akaba aine emyaka makumi ana n'ebiri, obu yaatandika kutegyeka, yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu omwaka gumwe. Nyina akaba naayetwa Atalia mwijukuru wa Omuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazia nawe yaagyendera omu micwe y'ab'enju ya Ahabu, ahabw'okuba nyina niwe yaabaire amuha obwegye kukora kubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, nk'oku ab'enju ya Ahabu baakozire; ahakuba ishe ku yaaherize kufa, baaguma nibamuha obwengye obwamucwekyereize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi akakuratira obwengye bwabo, yaagyenda na Yoramu mwene Ahabu omugabe wa Israeli kurwanisa Hazaeli omugabe wa Siria ahari Ramosi-gileadi. Abasiria baahutaaza Yoramu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yagaruka Yezereeli kurwarirayo obuhuta, obu baamuhutaariize Raama, obu baarwana na Hazaeli omugabe wa Siria. Bwanyima Ahazia mwene Yehoraamu omugabe wa Yuda yaashuuma Yezereeli kureeba Yoramu mwene Ahabu, ahakuba akaba arwaire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
