            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.9.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka kikaba kiteekateekirwe Ruhanga, ngu okufa kwa Ahazia kubeho agiire kureeba Yoramu. Ahakuba ku yaahikireyo, yaagyenda na Yoramu kubugana Yehu mwene Nimushi, ou MUKAMA yaashukireho amajuta kucwekyereza enju ya Ahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.10.11+2KI.10.12+2KI.10.13+2KI.10.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 10:11-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.24.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 24:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku yaabaire naaha ab'enju ya Ahabu ekifubiro, yaabugana abanyiginya ba Yuda na batabani ba barumuna ba Ahazia, abaabaire nibaheereza Amazia, yaabaita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.17.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 17:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.9.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 9:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima yaasherura Ahazia, baamukwata ayesherekire omuri Samaria, baamureetera Yehu, yaamwita. Baamuziika, ahabw'okuba bakagira ngu ni mwijukuru wa Yehoshafaati, owaabaire naasherura MUKAMA n'omutima gwe gwona. Okuruga aho enju ya Ahazia yaabura omuntu orikubaasa kutwara engoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
